Brand assets
------------

Files:
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/icon.png
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/icon@2x.png
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/logo.png
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/logo@2x.png
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/dark_logo.png
    custom_components/tplink_deco_r4/brand/dark_logo@2x.png

There is deliberately no dark_icon variant: upstream ships none for this brand,
and the icon is entirely mid-tone (no fully dark or fully light pixels), so it
reads on both light and dark backgrounds. The logo wordmark is dark and does
need the dark_logo variant.

